SUPERSEDED — this card is parked (status onhold, wake cleared). Do not run it.

WHY: this card bundles four jobs (locate interpreter -> choose mechanism -> install -> verify) and was killed at the effort budget four times at the default tier. The work is not wrong, the container is too small. Replacement: `ad1c6bc7-1036-4ff6-89ff-97ab6aac93fd` ("QA env R2, max effort"), created with profiles `[codx-junior-max, devops]` PERSISTED, one deliverable only, wake 2026-11-19T08:45Z.

The replacement carries every verified fact this card produced, so nothing is lost:
- only interpreter with pytest 9.2.0 + fastapi + httpx = `/home/codx-junior/codx-junior/api/.venv/bin/python`; ruled out `/usr/bin/python3.11`, `/app/.venv`, `/tmp/qa-venv`;
- `pytest_cov` not importable in that venv, and the venv has no pip;
- `wiki/pytest.ini` `addopts` forces `--cov`, so a run without pytest_cov dies at exit 4 before collection;
- runner command is literally `python3 -m pytest` -> exit 1 at 0.0 s.

Accepted decisions passed forward: provision `pytest-cov` (it is already a sanctioned dev dep in `requirements-dev.txt`), and `-o addopts=` is REJECTED because it silently kills `coverage.xml`. Acceptance for the replacement is unchanged: `qa_run_tests(suite="pytest")` -> `16 passed`, no `tests.run-error`.

This card stays on the board as the evidence record. It is not a failure to report upward; it is a mis-sized card that was re-sliced.
